message: "If you use this dataset or crosswalk, please cite it as below."
title: "Frontier AI-C(B)RN Commitments Observatory"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Smith
    given-names: Miranda
version: "0.7.6"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
url: "https://mirandas88.github.io/CBRN-Observatory/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MirandaS88/CBRN-Observatory"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A claim-level public record of frontier AI companies' commitments on chemical, biological,
  radiological and nuclear risk, with a focus on biology. Twelve published safety frameworks
  from ten companies are coded to one codebook and read against the EU General-Purpose AI
  Code of Practice, Safety and Security chapter.
keywords:
  - biosecurity
  - frontier AI
  - AI safety frameworks
  - CBRN
  - EU AI Act
  - Code of Practice
